atwater/       Atwater Study Plot, UT: in situ station forcing, WY2022-WY2026,
               snobal IPW format. WY2024 precipitation: use the _v2 file
               (the original precipitation column is 24 h late).
atwater_hrrr/  HRRR forcing extracted at the Atwater Study Plot
               (40.5915 N, 111.6378 W), WY2021-WY2024, hourly, UTC.

Please cite: Skiles, M. (2026). snobal-box forcing data. DOI to be added
when the data are archived on Zenodo.
